    dream_id: dream_20260514T221538
    project: gen-depth-fingerprint
    status: done
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 'D006 re-dream after framing repositioning. Key changes: (1) contribution
      explicitly positioned as empirical/conceptual not methodological — features
      are standard NLL stats, novelty is in problem formulation + dual dynamics finding
      + application; (2) OOD detection connection acknowledged (RC8); (3) text length
      confound controlled (plan_013); (4) downstream utility uses OLMo-1B not Pythia-410M
      to avoid reference model circularity, multiple seeds + CIs required (RC11);
      (5) 7B+ generator added as P1 (plan_014, RC9); (6) related work must be 30+
      references. Verify whether these changes address the structural issues that
      caused Best=5/Median=5/Worst=4 in previous dream.'
    what_if: []
