    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 'Paper has been significantly expanded since last dream (May 14). New additions:
      (1) 9-generator scale evaluation with Gemma-2-2B (Appendix), (2) DDR causality
      analysis with permutation importance + Granger causality + feature intervention,
      (3) TOST bootstrap stability validation, (4) cross-model evaluation upgraded
      from sample-level CV to generator-level LOGO (binary F1=0.830). Total 33 pages,
      20+ appendix experiments. Assess whether this is 3.0 Findings or 3.5 Borderline
      Conference level. Identify the single highest-impact improvement that could
      be made in 5 days before DDL.'
